    httpuv,
    jsonlite,
    keyring (>= 1.3.0),
    knitr,
    later,
    remotes,
    rlang,
    rstudioapi,
    shiny (>= 1.14.0)
Suggests:
    httr2,
    pdftools
URL: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant
BugReports: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant/issues
Config/RAssistant/Changes: Keep the model button beside Send on one compact line. Show the model name with an ellipsis when needed; retain the complete provider and model in its tooltip and inside the picker.
    Label the picker Provider & model and its confirmation Apply. Show the current connection and indicate which providers already have a key.
    Preserve the selected provider, model and custom endpoint when opening API settings to add a key, instead of reverting to the active connection. Automatic model discovery stays enabled.
